@startuml 00-modulos
title backend-java: módulos Maven y dependencias de compilación

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName sans-serif
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "lifeos-parent (pom raíz)" as parent {

  package "Sin Spring en el classpath" #EEF7EE {
    component "domain" as domain
    component "application" as application
  }

  package "Con Spring en el classpath" #FDF1E4 {
    component "infrastructure" as infrastructure
    component "adapter-rest" as rest
  }
}

component "spring-jdbc\nsqlite-jdbc" as jdbc #F5F5F5
component "spring-boot-starter-webmvc" as webmvc #F5F5F5

application --> domain
infrastructure --> application
rest --> infrastructure
infrastructure --> jdbc
rest --> webmvc

rest ..> application : transitiva
rest ..> domain : transitiva

note right of parent
  Hereda de spring-boot-starter-parent:
  aporta versiones y configuración de
  plugins, **no** agrega librerías.
  Lo único que el pom raíz pone en todos
  los módulos es JUnit 5 + AssertJ (scope test).
end note

legend bottom
  Flecha llena: dependencia declarada en el pom del módulo.
  Flecha punteada: visible por transitividad, sin declarar.
endlegend
@enduml
